                    ["3", "Groundwater recharge", "Recharge pits, percolation tanks, check dams send runoff into the aquifer"],
                    ["4", "Traditional systems", "Nepal's dhara and kuwa springs, stone spout systems; India's stepwells and khadin tanks"],
